   "evidence": "The proof at lines 200-206 uses only that `u.hahnModuleMap` maps lattices into lattices, which every continuous linear map does up to an index shift. Roadmap `FormalLaurentPuiseux/README.md:175-176`: \"The dt factor gives the coordinate-covariant description; changing parameters transforms forms too.\"",
