   "fix": "Define the general pullback `(\u03c6 : HahnModule \u2124 R V \u2192L[R] HahnModule \u2124 R W) \u2192 (HahnModule \u2124 R W \u2192L[R] R) \u2192L[R] (HahnModule \u2124 R V \u2192L[R] R)`, with `\u2113 \u21a6 \u2113.comp \u03c6` (i.e. `\u03c6.lcomp`), and prove its continuity from `(hasBasis_nhds_zero_lattice R V).tendsto_iff (hasBasis_nhds_zero_lattice R W)` applied to `\u03c6`. Then get `hahnModuleDualMap u` as this pullback at `u.hahnModuleMap`, and derive `_id`/`_comp` from the general identities.",
   "issue": "`hahnModuleDualMap` takes `u : V \u2192\u2097[R] W` and proves continuity through `of_map_mem_lattice`. That works for any `\u03c6 : HahnModule \u2124 R V \u2192L[R] HahnModule \u2124 R W`: by continuity, for each `a` there is some `b` with `\u03c6(U_(-b)(V)) \u2286 U_(-a)(W)`, so `\u2113 \u21a6 \u2113.comp \u03c6` sends `annihilatorLattice R W a` into `annihilatorLattice R V b`. Restricting to coefficientwise maps leaves out the parameter-change maps the roadmap needs next.",
